  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-Donor Fund for the Platform for Action on the Green Recovery of Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This fund supports Ukraine&apos;s recovery by focusing on cleaning up and protecting the environment. It helps gather important information about the damage caused by the conflict, supports the safe removal of hazardous materials, and promotes sustainable rebuilding practices. The fund works with local and international partners to develop green policies, improve public administration, and support eco-friendly projects. Its goal is to protect human health, boost the economy, and ensure a greener future for Ukraine. The fund&apos;s methods and successes can also serve as a model for other countries facing similar challenges, fostering international cooperation and sustainable development worldwide. The Platform aims also at supporting a new financial constitution which will enable faster and more efficient use of resources by IFIs and donors.</narrative>
  </description>
